<h3>Professional profile</h3>
<p>Software developer building payment systems in C#/.NET and TypeScript/Vue, with published applied machine-learning and mathematical-modelling research. Led development of an agricultural traceability demonstrator integrating decentralised identity and verifiable credentials.</p>

<h3>Technical skills</h3>
<p>Software engineering: C#/.NET, TypeScript, Vue, React, Node.js/Express, Python/Flask, REST APIs and SQL.</p>
<p>Testing and delivery: automated testing, Docker, Linux, Git, GitHub Actions and Azure DevOps.</p>
<p>ML experimentation: PyTorch, PyTorch Lightning and scikit-learn; Optuna for hyperparameter optimisation and Weights &amp; Biases for experiment tracking.</p>

